{"toolCallId":"call_4ac625a0b5df43d791f7a1cc91ca8146","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"[speckit] Skipping branch creation (--skip-branch)\ndescription.json created in /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  SpecKit: Spec Folder Created Successfully\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  BRANCH_NAME:  001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n  FEATURE_NUM:  001\n  DOC_LEVEL:    Level 3\n  SPEC_FOLDER:  /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n\n  Created Structure:\n  └── 001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/\n      ├── spec.md\n      ├── plan.md\n      ├── tasks.md\n      ├── implementation-summary.md\n      ├── acceptance-criteria.md\n      ├── description.json\n      ├── description.json   (per-folder identity)\n      └── scratch/          (working files; NOT git-ignored)\n          └── .gitkeep\n\n  Level 3 Documentation (manifest-backed Level contract):\n    ✓ Core: spec.md + plan.md + tasks.md\n    ✓ Lifecycle: implementation-summary.md (scaffolded; required after implementation starts)\n    ✓ +Verify: merged verification/testing in tasks.md, NFRs, edge cases\n    ✓ +Arch: executive summary, risk matrix, decision guidance\n      (Architecture decisions - adds ~150 LOC)\n\n  Next steps:\n    1. Fill out spec.md with requirements\n    2. Create implementation plan in plan.md\n    3. Break down tasks in tasks.md\n    4. Add verification items to tasks.md\n    5. Add on-demand docs with --with-lazy-addons when needed\n    6. Add goal.md with --with-goal or /create:go